On closing Bug Reports. Norbert Tretkowski [23]asserted that
regardless of the severity of a bug report, closing it with a comment
like "who cares?" is not okay. And there is obviously at least one
person who cares about this particular problem: the submitter of that
bug report. He added that if the maintainer doesn't want to fix a bug,
it should be tagged wontfix.

