 		Kaz Kojima
 		Guido Guenther
 		David Mosberger
 		Carlos O'Donell
 		Alfred M. Szmidt
 		Paolo Bonzini
 		GOTO Masanori


Enjoy!
Roland McGrath for the GNU C Library Developers


