  59. http://www.spi-inc.org/
  60. http://lists.spi-inc.org/pipermail/spi-announce/2004/000089.html
  61. http://www.spi-inc.org/corporate/board
  62. http://www.spi-inc.org/~jgoerzen/ar2004/spi2004.html

