IBM strikes at SCO claims
http://info.redhat.com/a/tBBIpT8AJPSNNASgHN1AK59txfa/apaa25

IBM has taken another swing at the SCO Group's faltering attack on
Linux, filing a motion seeking dismissal of SCO's contract claims.

